35,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The tally shows two people use it eleven times, others only four.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The last awkward talk happened in front of everyone. We need privacy.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,Lunch takes twenty-five minutes. Facilities had eleven callouts for equipment.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"We paid 68,000 yen for outside hire. Fit-outs cost 141,000 or 96,000.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,The wall is thin plasterboard. I can hear everything. Crumbs are everywhere.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Shunichi, if we pay for outside hire, why not fix this room?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Servas, if the wall is thin, a quiet room is impossible without soundproofing.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Ryuji, if we eat here, we save twenty-five minutes a day.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@May, 96,000 yen for a kitchen is cheaper than the meeting setup.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Jonathan, soundproofing is expensive. Maybe we accept the noise?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The fridge clear-out was a mess. Who cleans up after a kitchen?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"A meeting space needs a screen. That costs 141,000 yen.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"If we make it a kitchen, we need to agree on cleaning duties.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The meeting space is more expensive. The kitchen is cheaper.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,A kitchen brings crumbs. A meeting room brings silence. Which do we want?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am leaning towards the kitchen. It saves time and money.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,I prefer a meeting space. We need a place to talk properly.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,I support the kitchen. The time saved is significant.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"The numbers favor the kitchen. 96,000 yen is a better investment.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,"I will go with the kitchen. It is practical, even if messy.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
